{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_005_1000_p", "source_sha256": "af30d40a27557ff9e1cc7e7fbebd849d0099437927070127ff552378f55b394c", "ja": "（先日、翼が十代向け流行発信番組の\nオーディションを受けた。結果は……）", "zh": "（前些日子，翼参加了一个面向十几岁年轻人的流行资讯节目选拔。结果是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_005_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "09010371090b3053296aa4fd4b6a57f3ce1e397ce6ecc2fbcb6bcec40c50ea39", "ja": "え～っ！　不合格ですか！？", "zh": "诶～！没通过吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_005_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e4f4ac35f59445e738b7720cd81d16df572559dfbe778974bc738c6152c825a0", "ja": "今回のお仕事、絶対\nわたしにピッタリだと思ったのに……。", "zh": "我还以为这次的工作绝对适合我呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_005_1003_p", "source_sha256": "faed4897939c1b79d598335b7404bf710780663788e814118efb796eda53e7c3", "ja": "そうだな……。俺も手応えを感じたから、\n受かると思っていたんだが……。", "zh": "是啊……我也觉得很有希望，所以以为能通过，没想到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_005_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "46d616095c730d0f6565831610cec870dd6e63d5752c033a8ede6f267b9c635c", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、そう思いますよね？\nう～ん……あっ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生也这么觉得对吧？\n唔～……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_005_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8f8103f923ec1e90d8077f476fd6f9287ed212e49148549a95b534eb29eb2cc9", "ja": "もしかして、誰かと間違えてるんじゃないですか？\nホントは、わたしが合格してるのかも！", "zh": "说不定是弄错成别人了呢？\n其实合格的可能是我才对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_005_1006_p", "source_sha256": "234a6f2481c5b2bdfac63d5370cd11ff7659f6497bc262d4a6e31bb0908110b9", "ja": "いや、それはないんだ。合格者は、\n翼と一緒に面接を受けた子のひとりだって聞いた。", "zh": "不，不是那样。听说合格者是和翼一起参加面试的其中一个孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_005_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "70133054226e8a963e60859a81bb360c5436f385339d81169d936a51e1ca8d55", "ja": "え～～～っ！？　なんで？　あの中だったら、\nわたしが一番上手に台本読めたのに……。", "zh": "诶～～～！？为什么？明明在那些人里，\n我才是台词念得最好的那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_005_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "37f1a66bafca009184efc0a7d19c407007820f64a1ac89aeeaf69a895328a1ce", "ja": "なのになんで？　なんでなんでなんで～！", "zh": "明明这样，为什么？为什么为什么为什么～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_005_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "17ec2a3dedadf9414c209562cb518b6348d40ba24c31f96156483b2084817a75", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\nこんなんじゃわたし、納得できませんよ～！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n这样的话，我可没法接受啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_005_1010_p", "source_sha256": "ac7d9fb6c54bb9f88cf0fa782bb590cc17d6c7526eec1defae17b8b1e071435e", "ja": "翼。落ちた原因を考えるのは、悪い事じゃない。\nけどそれは、次の仕事に繋げるためだ。", "zh": "翼，考虑落选的原因并不是什么坏事。不过，这是为了将其运用到下一份工作中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_005_1011_p", "source_sha256": "24cfbbfc1a6f0a025b6a77db2390a041a0ab23fdfcf386b5f9f550c9981f0149", "ja": "今回の結果は、番組の性質と候補者の適正を総合的に\n判断して……との事だ。また次、頑張るしかないよ。", "zh": "这次的结果，据说是综合考虑了节目的性质和候选人的适合度……才做出的判断。我们只能下次再努力了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_005_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "256994674c4e4e36a6628f8a3fbde7b702e57357fbb9fdf63a69cf84e2da0466", "ja": "むう～……{$P$}さん、\nどうして、そんなイジワル言うんですか？", "zh": "唔～……{$P$}先生，为什么要说这么坏心眼的话呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_005_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5fa817cb4f14c7cc91bb40092d3b884716cf044f7e77053f8f460af0323801e1", "ja": "わたし、ちゃんと言われたとおりにしたのに！\n台本だって、たくさん読む練習したんだから……。", "zh": "我明明都有好好照着说的去做！\n台词也有好好练习读了很多遍的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_005_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4e5aad0c9f09c3dab467a7b8d8f78587f038e94628e942e45d908a772d7504aa", "ja": "なのに、また次がんばれ、なんて……。\nそんな簡単に言わないでくださいよ……。", "zh": "明明我已经按照说好的做了！\n连剧本我都练习读了好多遍……\n\n可即便这样，还是对我说什么下次再努力……\n请不要这么轻易地说出口啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_005_1015_p", "source_sha256": "e72bca5bea14b18312e68d2a0d104c1f8ef1d75a70810dae58f2ad21852993e1", "ja": "翼……。", "zh": "翼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_005_1016_p", "source_sha256": "6c4d5586dfeab52c1d9420e59141651de0d06ebe0d45589bf4072608d8f21577", "ja": "（オーディションは厳しい世界だ。翼にも、\n心理的な負担をかけているとは思う。けど……）", "zh": "（试镜是个残酷的世界。我想，心理上的负担也给翼造成了不小的压力。可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_005_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6115bb3ab3e08574b9a5b783d967c9745acb324dd8341da83c22f902eaf036e7", "ja": "がんばったのに、こんな悔しい思いするなんて……\nわたしもう、オーディションなんて受けたくない……。", "zh": "明明已经努力过了，却还要承受这么不甘心的感受……\n我再也不想参加试镜了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_005_1018_p", "source_sha256": "503ad36dde161c25ee428c947931dee0b86e3dde782bd1452a93caf3dac09fab", "ja": "そうか。けど俺は、翼本来の力を発揮する事が\nできたら、絶対に合格できると思ってるよ。", "zh": "这样啊。不过我觉得，只要翼能发挥出原本的实力，就一定能通过甄选。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_005_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "45ad6364ec309e172483539a7675eae96c2a9ef6debbaadc57e26dbb4d7b1589", "ja": "わたし本来の力……？", "zh": "我本来的力量……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_005_1020_p", "source_sha256": "149a2416f97c1bbb79ea2e9132b312488a6264c6d31e128981d297ba50126e8f", "ja": "オーディションの限られた時間の中で、\n自分の魅力を出しきるっていうのは、難しい事なんだ。", "zh": "在试镜有限的时间里，要充分展现自己的魅力，是件很难的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_005_1021_p", "source_sha256": "329472706814bfbeb1f58baa4df8ceca8b5f7d2f8cd1b4e98dd09d57dcbe023c", "ja": "けど、翼のいいところがきちんと伝われば、みんな\n翼を選ぶはずだ。翼には、それだけの魅力がある！", "zh": "不过，只要能让大家充分感受到翼的优点，他们一定会选择翼。翼就是有这样的魅力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_005_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_005_1023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2949e429bc1776945c408026fddf7c30852f0a2bacd8d7eb17037e3dae9edd66", "ja": "ホントに……わたしなら、オーディション\n絶対合格できるって思う……？", "zh": "你真的觉得……要是我的话，就一定能通过试镜吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_005_1024_p", "source_sha256": "c341140f38983d4ab110a844422ee8d2526c166313ce13733db11356ef404b3d", "ja": "もちろん！　翼をスカウトしたのは、俺だからな。", "zh": "当然了！毕竟把翼发掘出来的，可是我啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_005_1025_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c9d217a9e65d72f275d2aa782c1d59c888cad906ab675f930706698d1843239d", "ja": "……そうですよ～。わたしをスカウトしたのは、\n{$P$}さんなんだから。", "zh": "……就是说嘛～。既然发掘我的是\n{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_005_1026_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4b19fe9ec92bbb21f59c88b9b7c75ef04ccfccb440038d1ddc84957de27f5805", "ja": "{$P$}さんが、そんなに言うなら……\nわたし、またオーディション受けてみようかな。", "zh": "既然{$P$}先生都说到这个份上了……\n那我，要不就再去参加一次试镜吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_005_1027_p", "source_sha256": "1586230318bd7e5a0e4a9041deef1908ce1447938f98415cc9abd94a167e2303", "ja": "翼……ああ！　次も、一緒に頑張ろうな！", "zh": "翼……啊！下次也一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_005_1028_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d236bc98da3a28cf0a88c44010e04c51c038a8c57b0b491ae1996c990da4f4ec", "ja": "でもでも、次は絶対受からなくちゃイヤだから。\nちょっとだけなら、レッスン増やしてもいいですよ？", "zh": "不过不过，下次我可一定要通过才行，不然我会不开心的。要是只增加一点点训练，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_005_1029_016tsu", "source_sha256": "16e81a12263d3b74b8f9b6c5119ed2fd5537da45c56da5c606144082ce7e5f2e", "ja": "そのかわり～……合格したら、\nごほうびにデートしてくださいね！　約束で～す♪", "zh": "不过作为交换～……要是通过了，\n请奖励我和我约会吧！说好了哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_005_1030_p", "source_sha256": "d1cc65c3cf8d153dd97142ef2f8ee4268729e158029cbf0d6400ffe98da4acc8", "ja": "（翼の顔に、ようやく笑顔が戻った。\n改めて頑張ると決意してくれて、本当によかった……）", "zh": "（翼的脸上终于重新露出了笑容。她能重新下定决心努力，真是太好了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_005_1031_p", "source_sha256": "0cfd3e1886f4c6dae977282d91d8d08d71d4e3f6db2df29ca36e6e516b22332b", "ja": "（翼のポテンシャルを、最大限引き出してやりたいな。\nその時こそ、本人が納得する結果が得られるはずだ！）", "zh": "（我想最大限度地发挥出翼的潜力。\n那样的话，她一定就能得到自己满意的结果了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
